        <mxCell id="p0-pdpplace-8" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;every decision crosses the WAN: latency ≈ WAN RTT + PDP time&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;WAN partition ⇒ every request denied (fail closed)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;revocation takes effect immediately&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;one place to secure and audit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1" parent="p0-opt0">
