        <mxCell id="p0-pdpplace-15" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:2px 0 0 0;padding-left:16px;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;fog cache answers repeated (subject, action, resource) locally&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;miss ⇒ cloud PDP; denies are never cached&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;partition ⇒ only recently cached allows survive until their TTL&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;staleness ≤ min(TTL, epoch poll interval)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1" parent="p0-opt1">
